      "concern": "Statement (b) says 'Let ρ,J∈D′(Ω) be the point-source distributions'. The opened supplier lem-em-point-current-continuity types ρ as one distribution and J as a triple of distributions. The subsequent componentwise history integral makes the intended vector current clear, but the displayed type for J should be (D′(Ω))³.",
